WEBVTT

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:31.036
they were met with a challenge.

00:02:31.076 --> 00:02:34.556
"Who are you and what are
your authorities to tell us off?

00:02:34.556 --> 00:02:35.716
Go away!"

00:02:37.636 --> 00:02:40.916
Logging an encroachment
that happened upstream

00:02:40.956 --> 00:02:44.396
soon turned into disasters downstream.

00:02:44.876 --> 00:02:47.436
A heavy rainfall
that lasted for a few days

00:02:47.476 --> 00:02:50.196
turned into flash floods and landslides,

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:54.036
destroying the village
and its essential infrastructure.

00:02:54.996 --> 00:02:56.316
After the disaster,

00:02:56.316 --> 00:02:59.436
Sumini and other villagers
had to take refuge

00:02:59.436 --> 00:03:01.196
in a shelter for a while.